$DIR/test.p:90:19: union DeviceState has no variant X (its variants are Off, Probing, Ready and Failed)
    The union has no variant with this name, or the type before the dot is not a
    union, so it has no variants at all. The message lists the variants the
    union has.
    (see "Unions" in the Plutonium spec, section 7.13)
